# The tox the action installs. tox.txt is the hashed lock generated from
# this file, with one tox per range of Python versions. Refresh it with
# the command in its header, moving --exclude-newer to seven days before
# the refresh; add --upgrade to move every pin. Dependabot cannot
# maintain it: it regenerates the lock for one interpreter and drops the
# per-version markers.
tox
